.Dt PHANTOM-MIRAGE-SNIFF 1
.Sh NAME
.Nm phantom-mirage-sniff
.Nd Phantom Mirage I passive traffic sniffer
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
